  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop capsicum. Slice lime into wedges.\n• Drain and rinse red kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67dacec58cac41d48147149b/step-92da7b00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook trimmed green beans and capsicum until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add mild Caribbean jerk seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in kidney beans, coconut milk, vegetable stock and the water.\n• Simmer until thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove from heat, then stir in baby spinach leaves until wilted. Season with salt and pepper to taste.\n• TIP: Add a splash more water if the curry looks too thick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67dacec58cac41d48147149b/step-5e0f8f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, microwave basmati rice until steaming, 2-3 minutes.\n• Stir in the butter and a squeeze of lime juice until coated. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67dacec58cac41d48147149b/step-707bbc20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Caribbean kidney bean coconut curry between bowls. Garnish with torn coriander.\n• Serve with zesty rice and any remaining lime wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67dacec58cac41d48147149b/step-85998e30.jpg"
    }
  ]
